{
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "organization": "ScaleDockHQ",
  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Self-host image, video, speech-to-text and text-to-speech servers in the same LiteLLM -> llama-swap stack as your LLMs: stable-diffusion.cpp sd-server and ComfyUI for images, ComfyUI native workflows for open video models, whisper.cpp, Speaches and vLLM for STT, Kokoro-FastAPI and Speaches for TTS. Covers OpenAI-compatible routes, llama-swap groups (exclusive vs co-resident), LiteLLM image/audio modes, end-to-end timeouts including Cloudflare 524, memory planning on discrete and unified GPUs, smoke tests and model licenses.",
